    x = arctan((2/3) * (1 * sin(60) + -2 * cos(30))) + 180 * n24
     (by Isolation)

Answer is : 
X1
  where :
    X1 =  x = 180 * n24 + arctan((2/3) * (-2 * cos(30) + sin(60)))


